---
import CursorPortrait from "~/pages/_components/CursorPortrait.astro";
---

<section class="wrapper mesh about-section">
  <h2 class="sr-only">About me</h2>
  <div class="mesh-center">
    <CursorPortrait />
    <p>I'm Kristof, software engineer with a backend-leaning full stack profile. Most of my work lives on the server side, but I'm just as happy shaping the frontend or a native app when a product needs clarity, polish, or a better user or developer experience.</p>
    <p>Over the years I've worked across government, telecom, finance, mobility, and internal product teams, building everything from microservices and event-driven systems to modern frontends. I like software that's practical, well-structured, and a little bit opinionated.</p>
    <p>Outside client work, I tend to disappear into technical rabbit holes: operating systems, developer tooling, awkward platform quirks, and the kind of bugs that turn into a good story afterwards.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .about-section {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .about-portrait {
      grid-column: 1;
      width: 10rem;
      justify-self: center;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .mesh-center {
      grid-column: 1;
    }
  }
</style>
